    "text": "For $0\\leq k\\leq n$ write $ \\binom{n}{k} = uv $ where the only primes dividing $u$ are in $[2,k]$ and the only primes dividing $v$ are in $(k,n]$.\nLet $f(n)$ be the smallest $k$ such that $u>n^2$. Give bounds for $f(n)$.",
